B.Aw=new A.qX(B.ki,"100% Private","All processing stays on your device. Not a single frame of video ever leaves your phone \u2014 guaranteed.","On-device ML",B.Jq,null)
B.Zm=new A.it("What does joining the iOS waitlist get me?","Priority access when we launch on iOS, a founding-member discount on premium features, and updates on our progress. If you refer friends using your personal referral link, you'll move up the queue.",null)
B.Zn=new A.it("How does Drowzy detect drowsiness?","Drowzy uses your phone's front camera to monitor your eyes in real time. It measures how long your eyes are closed using the PERCLOS algorithm \u2014 a scientifically validated method used in driver monitoring research. When your eyes remain closed beyond a safe threshold, the alarm fires immediately. All processing happens entirely on your device; no video is ever stored or transmitted.",null)
B.Zo=new A.it("When does the iPhone version launch?","Drowzy is currently in final App Store review. Waitlist members are notified first, in the order they joined \u2014 with priority given to anyone who referred friends. Join the waitlist above to lock in your spot.",null)
B.Zp=new A.it("Is my camera feed stored or shared?","No. Drowzy never stores, records, or transmits your camera feed. Video frames are processed on your device in real time and discarded immediately after analysis. Nothing leaves your phone.",null)
B.Zq=new A.it("Will Drowzy work in the background?","Drowzy continues monitoring even if you switch briefly to another app or your screen dims once a drive session has started. For best results, keep the app in the foreground with your screen on and your phone mounted so the front camera has a clear view of your face.",null)
B.Zr=new A.it("How do I delete my account and data?","You can delete your account directly inside the app: go to Profile \u2192 scroll down \u2192 Delete Account, then type DELETE to confirm. All your data \u2014 trip history, safety scores, and account information \u2014 is permanently erased from our servers immediately.",null)
B.Zs=new A.it("Do I need an account to use Drowzy?","No. Guest mode lets you start a drive and receive alerts without signing in, with trip history stored locally on your device for up to 3 free drives. Creating a free account unlocks cloud backup, cross-device sync, and a 7-day free trial of premium features.",null)
B.Zt=new A.it("Where can I download Drowzy?",'Drowzy for Android is available today on Google Play \u2014 search "Drowzy" or use the Download on Google Play button anywhere on this page. iPhone users can join the waitlist below and we\'ll email you the moment the iOS version is approved.',null)
